1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:02,730
Anthropic, the company behind the Claude AI

2
00:00:02,780 --> 00:00:05,550
models, is now a public company

3
00:00:05,600 --> 00:00:09,070
Yahoo Finance reports it sold 980 million shares

4
00:00:09,120 --> 00:00:14,850
at $83 each, above the $70 to $78 range it had marketed

5
00:00:14,900 --> 00:00:17,870
That valued Anthropic at about $1.5 trillion

6
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:20,410
on a fully diluted basis

7
00:00:20,460 --> 00:00:23,630
The BBC says shares closed 17% higher on day

8
00:00:23,680 --> 00:00:29,823
one at $97.17, even as the wider tech sector fell 2.4%

9
00:00:29,873 --> 00:00:34,210
Third-quarter revenue hit $16.96 billion, up

10
00:00:34,260 --> 00:00:36,650
47% from the prior quarter

11
00:00:36,700 --> 00:00:39,470
But the company still runs at an operating loss

12
00:00:39,520 --> 00:00:43,990
It has committed to spending about $895 billion

13
00:00:44,040 --> 00:00:46,770
with roughly half promised by 2030

14
00:00:46,820 --> 00:00:49,410
For the Gulf, watch whether this new capital

15
00:00:49,460 --> 00:00:52,030
flows into data centers and compute partnerships

16
00:00:52,080 --> 00:00:52,810
across the region
